  "job_B1.3.35_20251001_193219": {
    "chunk_text": "XI KAL FEBR, PASSIO SANCTI VINCENTII MARTYRIS. ON Ispanian lande \u00fe\u00e6re Speoniscan leode w\u00e6s se halga martir \u00fee hatte Uincentius to menn geboren, & \u00dea aras seo ehtnys \u00fe\u00e6ra arleasra cweller\u00e6 wide geond \u00feas world wodlice swi\u00f0e ongean Cristes On \u00feam dagum w\u00e6s \u00fea sum heretoga w\u00e6lhreow, Datianus gehatan swi\u00f0e hetol ehtere on anre Him geu\u00fee \u00fea se casere, swa swa us cy\u00fea\u00f0 bec, \u00fe\u00e6t se w\u00e6lhreowa ehtere \u00feone anweald h\u00e6fde, \u00fe\u00e6t he Hw\u00e6t \u00fea Datianus, se deofollica cwellere, on \u00feam anwealde \u00fee he underfangen h\u00e6fde, gecydde his Wolde \u00e6rest \u00fea heafodmen \u00fe\u00e6s halgan geleafan mid witum oferswi\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t he sy\u00f0\u00f0an mihte \u00fea l\u00e6ssan \u00dea efste se bisceop & se eadiga Uincentius to \u00feam \u00e6\u00f0elan martirdome; \u00feohtan \u00fe\u00e6t hi wurdon witodlice Datianus \u00fea, se deofollica ehtere, het gebringan \u00fea halgan gebundene mid racenteagum into anre burig And let hi liggan swa on meteleaste, swi\u00f0e micclum gehefegode mid \u00feam heardan isene; hopode \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00c6fter langsumum fyrste he het hi gebringan him to; wende \u00fe\u00e6t hi w\u00e6ron mid \u00feam witum fornumene, Hi comon \u00fea begen mid bli\u00f0um mode and mid f\u00e6gerum andwlitum & ansundum lichamum to \u00feam Hi cw\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t hi hym on na\u00feor ne dydon. He ne mihte na tocnaw\u00e6n \u00fe\u00e6t Crist sylf hi afed",
